From 1e088a4ceceaba17a7f0959e9921a9fc5ade6d09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DSH-Adapt <adapt@local>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 14:31:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] WIP: SUSFS 2.3 core files + exec/open/stat hooks +
 Re:Kernel driver + KABI fixes

- fs/susfs.c, include/linux/susfs*.h: official SUSFS v2.3.0 (susfs4ksu gki-android12-5.10)
- fs/exec.c: susfs inline hooks (sucompat + post_execveat) replacing KSU_MANUAL_HOOK
- fs/open.c: do_faccessat getname_flags+filename_lookup pattern (2.3 style)
- fs/stat.c: sus_kstat result_mask transport (5.4-adapted, no mnt_id), vfs_statx_fd init_rc hook
- include/linux/sched.h, sched/user.h: ANDROID_KABI padding for SYSVIPC/POSIX_MQUEUE (from LuoJuly f05b8df8)
- drivers/rekernel: Re:Kernel driver (from LuoJuly b133a190)
- drivers/android/binder.c: rekernel_binder_transaction hook (from LuoJuly b68efe6b)
